DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE color ON crop TYPE string PERMISSIONS FULL;

DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE createdAt ON eats TYPE datetime PERMISSIONS FULL;
DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE in ON eats TYPE record PERMISSIONS FULL;
DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE out ON eats TYPE record PERMISSIONS FULL;
DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE place ON eats TYPE string PERMISSIONS FULL;

DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE created_at ON eats_snake_case TYPE datetime PERMISSIONS FULL;
DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE in ON eats_snake_case TYPE record PERMISSIONS FULL;
DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE out ON eats_snake_case TYPE record PERMISSIONS FULL;
DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE place ON eats_snake_case TYPE string PERMISSIONS FULL;

DEFINE FIELD OVERWRITE checksum_up ON migration TYPE string PERMISSIONS FULL;
